FROM golang:1.25.13-alpine AS builder
WORKDIR /app
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download
COPY . ./
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -o /out/sprintorio-updater ./cmd/updater

FROM alpine:3.21
ARG OPENSSL_MIN_VERSION=3.3.7-r2
RUN apk add --no-cache --upgrade "libcrypto3>=${OPENSSL_MIN_VERSION}" "libssl3>=${OPENSSL_MIN_VERSION}" bash ca-certificates docker-cli docker-cli-compose git openssh-client
WORKDIR /repo
COPY --from=builder /out/sprintorio-updater /usr/local/bin/sprintorio-updater
EXPOSE 8081
CMD ["sprintorio-updater"]
